.git
.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/dist
# `**/dist` drops raw Vite build dirs (e.g. ui/dist in sibling checkouts) —
# it must never drop the STAGED React build. scripts/build-vnext.sh copies
# that to src/personal_world/static/vnext/ (no `dist` segment), and the
# Dockerfile's `COPY src` ships it so the app can serve /vnext/. Any new
# rule added here must not match that path.
# recursive: a frontend/.env would be read by Vite at build time and
# inlined into the public bundle — it must never enter the build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
data/
config/*.local.json
config/principal.json
config.local/
frontend-v2/
design/exports/
*.log
.pytest_cache